// Block scope. scnames holds the names visible at the point the walk has
// reached: the parameters, then each declaration once its initializer has been
// walked. Leaving a block cuts the list back to what was visible on entry, so a
// name declared inside an if, an else or a while body cannot be seen after it.

// Split from acc_while so that block stays within the action limit.
acc_while_body(int id, string owner) {
  int[] l1_of_v = l1_of(id);
  acc_block(l1_of_v, owner);
} return void;
